  "known_local_policies": [
    "Both Secrets use the original active opponent hand-spell commit/window. Automatic CAST is not a manual hand window; already countered windows do not consume another Secret.",
    "Ice Trap counters the original attempt without refund; returns the same original graveyard residence to its physical owner, resets ordinary hand costs and installs +1 before arrival observers. Existing native spell value and carved weapon materials remain intrinsic. Full-hand return uses an explicit graveyard-delivery overflow, never another death.",
    "Oh My Yogg uses the original PlayRecord cost, including actual submission discounts, and casts for the original caster from complete constructed.cards Standard membership at that cost. All classes, normal weights and exclusions remain; no filtering by executable coverage or target availability.",
    "Replacement targets and choices use existing automatic random policies; a spell with no legal target keeps the normal failed-attempt result and is not rerolled. Exact same-spell eligibility, hand-spend/CardPlayed observer order and current CN/hotfix details remain local boundaries.",
    "Public2021/2022/2024 first-person reports support no refund, resetting repeated Ice Trap tax, current-cost replacement, random retargeting and manual-hand-only counter windows. They are dated observations, not current CN certification."
  ]
